---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for FKN Wine: what data we process, why, and your rights. No tracking cookies."
>
  <section class="wrapper" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; max-width: 720px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5.5vw, 2.6rem);">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">1. Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>
      Nimar Moradbakhti<br />
      Mauritiusstr. 4a<br />
      44789 Bochum, Germany<br />
      Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">2. Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      This site is hosted on <strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong> (Cloudflare, Inc., USA).
      Cloudflare processes technically necessary data (IP address, browser type, timestamps) to
      deliver and protect the site (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR — legitimate interest). Cloudflare is
      certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">3. Cookies &amp; tracking</h2>
    <p>
      FKN Wine itself sets <strong>no tracking cookies</strong>. No Google Analytics, no ad
      pixels. Cloudflare may set technically necessary cookies for security and delivery (e.g.
      <code>__cf_bm</code>); these need no consent (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).
    </p>
    <p>
      If we introduce privacy-friendly, cookieless analytics later, this page will say so before
      it goes live.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">4. Newsletter</h2>
    <p>
      When our email list opens: signup uses a double opt-in process (confirm link in your inbox),
      your address is used only to send the newsletter, and every email contains an unsubscribe
      link. The email service provider used will be named here before the list opens. Legal basis:
      your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR); you can withdraw it anytime.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">5. External links (incl. affiliate links)</h2>
    <p>
      We link to external shops and services. Once you follow a link, the destination site's own
      privacy policy applies. Some outbound links may be affiliate links (see our
      <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a>).
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">6. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under the GDPR you have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of
      processing, data portability, and objection (Art. 15–21 GDPR). You can lodge a complaint
      with a supervisory authority (Art. 77 GDPR) — for us: the State Commissioner for Data
      Protection and Freedom of Information of North Rhine-Westphalia, Germany.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">7. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If our setup changes (e.g. analytics or newsletter provider), this page is updated before
      the change goes live. The version on this page is always the current one.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.6;">Last updated: October 2026</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
